een failing for 2 restarts in a row.\\n\\nStarting a new session to address it.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6942111432\"}\n{\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- hive-mind:working-session-summary --\\u003e\\n## Working session summary\\n\\nUpdated [PR #142](https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142): resolved merge conflicts, fixed stale nucleus strength, and corrected the merged WASM size budget. Regression tests, Rust checks, lint and supporting workflows pass.\\n\\n**CI remains failing:** all nine runtime jobs reproduce the same three quality failures—63.33% nucleus recall, insufficient class accuracy and four missing landmark edges.\\n\\nReproductions show an 81.67% recall ceiling under the prescribed rules and incompatible timing requirements. Evidence and the required npm setup are documented in the PR. It remains a draft; issue #62 is unfinished.\\n\\n---\\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6942614271\"}\n{\"body\":\"## 🔄 Auto-restart-until-mergeable Log 2/5\\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\\n\\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\\n- Model: GPT-6.1 Sol\\n- Provider: OpenAI\\n- Public pricing estimate: $2.620362\\n\\n### 📊 **Context and tokens usage:**\\n- 253.7K / 272K (93%) input tokens, 32.7K / 128K (26%) output tokens\\n\\nTotal: (253.7K + 5.6M cached) input tokens, 32.7K output tokens, $2.620362 cost\\n\\n### 🤖 **Models used:**\\n- Tool: OpenAI Codex\\n- Requested: `gpt-6.1-sol`\\n- Thinking level: xhigh (~31999 tokens)\\n- **Model: GPT-6.1 Sol** (`gpt-6.1-sol`)\\n\\n### 📎 **Log file uploaded as Gist** (6147KB)\\n- [View complete solution draft log](https://gist.githubusercontent.com/konard/9e7dcc6860287fa81645f6f0359240f4/raw/b7519a6cf16615c1f2a40494b7271cd1634021a9/tmp-hive-mind-log-upload-jcWhgC-sanitized.log.txt)\\n\\n---\\n*Now working session is ended, feel free to review and add any feedback on the solution draft.*\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6942648700\"}\n{\"body\":\"## 🔄 Auto-restart 3/5\\n\\n**Reason:** CI failures detected\\n\\n**Evidence:**\\n- Failing check: Pipeline Status — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133908541884\\n- Failing check: Test (bun, windows-2025) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935781\\n- Failing check: Test (deno, macos-15) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935766\\n- Failing check: Test (deno, ubuntu-24.04) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935752\\n- Failing check: Test (deno, windows-2025) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935741\\n- Failing check: Test (bun, ubuntu-24.04) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935658\\n- Failing check: Test (node, macos-15) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935651\\n- Failing check: Test (node, ubuntu-24.04) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935638\\n- Failing check: Test (node, windows-2025) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935635\\n- Failing check: Test (bun, macos-15) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44044032753/job/133905935622\\n\\n⚠️ The same checks have been failing for 3 restarts in a row.\\n\\nStarting a new session to address it.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6942697692\"}\n{\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- hive-mind:working-session-summary --\\u003e\\n## Working session summary\\n\\nUpdated [PR #142](https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142) with streaming suppression and archive-download fixes, and merged latest `main`.\\n\\nAll CI workflows finished. The new regressions pass across all nine runners, but each runtime job still fails three quality tests: nuclei, broad classes, and landmark edges.\\n\\nThe investigation shows the required peak rules permit at most 81.67% nucleus coverage, below the required 90%, and identifies conflicting timing requirements. These blockers, remaining quality failures, and the default-branch npm credential action are documented in the PR. It remains draft and unmerged.\\n\\n---\\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6944387710\"}\n{\"body\":\"## 🔄 Auto-restart-until-mergeable Log 3/5\\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\\n\\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\\n- Model: GPT-6.1 Sol\\n- Provider: OpenAI\\n- Public pricing estimate: $6.250658\\n\\n### 📊 **Context and tokens usage:**\\n- 463.5K input tokens across requests (cumulative, larger than the 272K context window, so not one request's context), 91.4K / 128K (71%) output tokens\\n\\nTotal: (463.5K + 15.1M cached) input tokens, 91.4K output tokens, $6.250658 cost\\n\\n### 🤖 **Models used:**\\n- Tool: OpenAI Codex\\n- Requested: `gpt-6.1-sol`\\n- Thinking level: xhigh (~31999 tokens)\\n- **Model: GPT-6.1 Sol** (`gpt-6.1-sol`)\\n\\n### 📎 **Log file uploaded as Gist** (9549KB)\\n- [View complete solution draft log](https://gist.githubusercontent.com/konard/516655effc96379ca808998d82bfac5c/raw/646940f016b8156cda5c44f5d53ba709ab2e45b7/tmp-hive-mind-log-upload-u2iBBS-sanitized.log.txt)\\n\\n---\\n*Now working session is ended, feel free to review and add any feedback on the solution draft.*\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6944452676\"}\n{\"body\":\"## 🔄 Auto-restart 4/5\\n\\n**Reason:** CI failures detected\\n\\n**Evidence:**\\n- Failing check: Pipeline Status — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/acti