ence that the prescribed peak rule cannot reach 90% on these signals, and that 60 ms immutable commitment conflicts with 150 ms retrospective cleanup. Those requirements need reconciliation; class and edge accuracy remain unresolved. No gates were weakened. The PR documents the evidence and the separate `NPM_TOKEN` setup required on `main`.\\n\\n---\\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6945405271\"}\n{\"body\":\"## 🔄 Auto-restart-until-mergeable Log 4/5\\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\\n\\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\\n- Model: GPT-6.1 Sol\\n- Provider: OpenAI\\n- Public pricing estimate: $3.928278\\n\\n### 📊 **Context and tokens usage:**\\n- 327.5K input tokens across requests (cumulative, larger than the 272K context window, so not one request's context), 50.5K / 128K (39%) output tokens\\n\\nTotal: (327.5K + 9.3M cached) input tokens, 50.5K output tokens, $3.928278 cost\\n\\n### 🤖 **Models used:**\\n- Tool: OpenAI Codex\\n- Requested: `gpt-6.1-sol`\\n- Thinking level: xhigh (~31999 tokens)\\n- **Model: GPT-6.1 Sol** (`gpt-6.1-sol`)\\n\\n### 📎 **Log file uploaded as Gist** (11905KB)\\n- [View complete solution draft log](https://gist.githubusercontent.com/konard/3abea56d7773dd9d524b6f6bd7451e7a/raw/cfdbed2f4088c45708622346dfcdb3dac0a356fd/tmp-hive-mind-log-upload-iHyMkr-sanitized.log.txt)\\n\\n---\\n*Now working session is ended, feel free to review and add any feedback on the solution draft.*\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/pull/142#issuecomment-6945491406\"}\n{\"body\":\"## 🔄 Auto-restart 5/5\\n\\n**Reason:** CI failures detected\\n\\n**Evidence:**\\n- Failing check: Pipeline Status — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/44062832031/job/133974238951\\n- Failing check: Test (deno, windows-2025) — https://github.com/konard/voice-simulator/actions/runs/4