[2026-11-17T12:16:01.310Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-11-17T12:16:01.315Z] [STDERR] +The preserved full log (`gh run view 44071097877 --repo konard/voice-simulator --log`) shows the Ubuntu Node failures at lines 15136, 15148 and 15162: nucleus recall, class accuracy and missing `apa`/`ama` edges respectively. Their assertion sites were `recognition-landmarks.test.js:174`, `:247` and `:280`. The updated suite retains those measurements and uses the revised, versioned acceptance limits alongside independent signal-rule checks.
